# Storefront rules

## Design
- Mobile-first **V4 Cyber-Organic**: dark `slate-950` + emerald semantic tokens (`docs/blueprint/5_UI_UX_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`).
- Do not apply admin light-theme patterns to the storefront.

## LCP / images
- Hero/banner: `next/image` with `priority={true}` on the **single** LCP candidate only.
- Never dual mobile+desktop hero priority — SSR one side via `ssb_vp` (`6_PERF_BUDGETS.md`).
- Every image container: defined aspect ratio or dimensions. Prefer WebP.

## A11y / cards
- One primary link per card — no duplicate URLs (`7_A11Y_CHECKLIST.md`).
- Interactive targets min 48×48px.

## SEO
- Canonical, sitemap, JSON-LD per `8_SEO_SCHEMA.md`.
- TH/EN metadata for storefront pages.

## Shell
- Never `dynamic()` the entire Navbar or root layout shell without PSI retest.
